{"parentUuid":"eaba99be-fe0d-470d-afae-d5edcc4c4c47","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfxR3noFLQgsbB4frLQ6m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The new cut is rendering: 104 seconds, about an hour, $0 spend. I'll message you when it's done.\n\n**What changed in the film**\n- **New scene 06 (24 s)** is your recording. It shows seven shots, each zoomed in so the text is readable at 1080p, with a label at the top:\n  1. Daily digest: the error rate went up.\n  2. Traces: one run failed.\n  3. Step 1: the agent deleted a test file. Rolled back.\n  4. Step 2: 5/5 tests, green.\n  5. Detection: Execution Failed.\n  6. Error analysis: grouped by cause.\n  7. Run comparison: the one red run.\n- **What the recording leaves out:** the moments when my chat window was on screen, and the browser tabs and address bar.\n- **New voice-over (Ava):**\n  - \"neatlogs caught it first: the digest flagged our error rate.\"\n  - \"The trace points to one step: the agent deleted a test file, and Kedge rolled it back.\"\n  - \"Step two fixed the real bug.\"\n  - \"Detections and error analysis group failures by cause, across every run, so we know what to fix next.\"\n- **Rest of the film:** Entire, cfo.ai, real PRs and the ending now play 16 seconds later, with the music and sound effects moved to match.\n\n**Everything the judges asked for is now covered:**\n- the problem: scenes 01–04;\n- cfo.ai and Entire: scenes 07–08;\n- neatlogs finding and fixing the failure: scene 06.\n\n**Committed and pushed** as `3248fbd`. The 106 MB raw recording is gitignored and stays only on your Mac, since it has your tabs and my chat in it.\n\nSubmissions are open until 23:55 IST. After the render, the steps are:\n1. Post the video.\n2. Send me the link for the README.\n3. Do the quote-post.\n\nI can write the quote-post text while the render runs if you want."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":991,"cache_read_input_tokens":274422,"output_tokens":705,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":66},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":991,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":705,"cache_read_input_tokens":274422,"cache_creation_input_tokens":991,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":991},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfxR3mqx5SHbDtyHz429F","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"481e291c-eabd-474c-b9bc-0ef4892f6e4b","timestamp":"2026-10-12T13:23:34.876Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/zorak/Documents/kedge","sessionId":"cd9da397-cf5a-4398-8a9d-d5ceb647cbb1","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"main","slug":"snoopy-knitting-penguin"}
