{"parentUuid":"a5a3d64a-c172-47ce-b2e2-d0b4da5ad98c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfxT4zVTutEiBDs2F261Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The video is ready, and I've sent it to you: [kedge-1080p60-audio.mp4](videos/out/kedge/v3/kedge-1080p60-audio.mp4). It's 104 seconds at 1080p60 with sound, and this is the file to post. It's saved in `videos/out/kedge/v3/`.\n\n**Checks:**\n- **Length:** exactly 1:44.00.\n- **Audio:** average −15.2 dB, peak −0.8 dB, so nothing clips.\n- **Scene 06:** all seven neatlogs shots are there, zoomed in and labelled, and none show my chat window. After it, the Entire, cfo.ai and ending scenes play in the right order.\n\n**One flaw:** about 2 seconds into the \"Detection: Execution Failed\" shot, the picture changes to the neatlogs analytics page while the label stays the same. It's brief, and fixing it means another hour-long render, so I'd post as is. The webm is still encoding, but you don't need it.\n\nTo submit, before 23:55 IST:\n1. Post the video and copy its link.\n2. Put that link and Haikeys' handle into the quote-post I drafted.\n3. Quote-tweet the official neatlogs post with it.\n4. Send me the video link, and I'll add it to the README and push."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":902,"cache_read_input_tokens":301972,"output_tokens":429,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":902,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":429,"cache_read_input_tokens":301972,"cache_creation_input_tokens":902,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":902},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transf